  "question": {
    "text": "Which one of the following complexes will have $\\Delta_0=0$ and $\\mu=5.96$ B.M.?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "hZkoy",
      "text": "$\\left[\\mathrm{Fe}(\\mathrm{CN})_6\\right]^4$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "jOdOR",
      "text": "$\\left[\\mathrm{CO}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_6\\right]^{3+}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EKneR",
      "text": "$\\left[\\mathrm{FeF}_6\\right]^4$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "KdVNJ",
      "text": "$\\left[\\mathrm{Mn}(\\mathrm{SCN})_6\\right]^4$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "(1) $\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_6\\right]^{3+} \\quad \\mathrm{Co}^{3+} \\Rightarrow 3 \\mathrm{~d}^6 4 \\mathrm{~s}^0$<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/tlN7QE7ms1XLmmW2k1bSQkXZ_O7a96mAYpsBEz2KOtM.original.fullsize.png\"/><br />$=[-0.4 \\times 6+0.6 \\times(0)] \\Delta_0=-2.4 \\Delta_0$<br />(2)<br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />& {\\left[\\mathrm{Mn}(\\mathrm{SCN})_6\\right]^4} \\\\<br>& \\mathrm{Mn}^{2+} \\Rightarrow 3 \\mathrm{~d}^5 4 \\mathrm{~s}^0<br />\\end{aligned}$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/96xXKp8GLWwc3l-gyaY4nyDhlZ43mT9q4bydGc9i1lA.original.fullsize.png\"/><br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />& \\mu=\\sqrt{35} \\text { B.M. }=5.96 \\text { B.M. } \\\\<br>& \\mathrm{CFSE}=(-0.4 \\times 3+0.6 \\times 2) \\Delta_0<br />\\end{aligned}$<br />So $\\Delta_0=0$<br />(3)<br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />& {\\left[\\mathrm{Fe}(\\mathrm{CN})_6\\right]^{-4} \\quad \\mathrm{Fe}^{2+} \\Rightarrow 3 \\mathrm{~d}^6 4 \\mathrm{~s}^0}<br />\\end{aligned}$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/mXbqJQQCxwBreyBTg7CuNsvWFhP334psJSplxk8tsy4.original.fullsize.png\"/><br />$\\mathrm{CFSE}=-2.4 \\Delta_0$<br />(4) $\\left[\\mathrm{FeF}_6\\right]^{4-}$<br />$\\mathrm{Fe}^{2+} \\Rightarrow 3 \\mathrm{~d}^6 4 \\mathrm{~s}^0$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/zqvcznomxHPLkpqdaC4cOWvkldF0f22bBKDvUFo9-cY.original.fullsize.png\"/><br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />& \\mu=\\sqrt{24} \\text { B.M. }=4.89 \\text { B.M. } \\\\<br>& \\text { CFSE }=(-0.4 \\times 4+0.6 \\times 2) \\Delta_0=-1.2 \\Delta_0<br />\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
